<title>HUNGARY: Hungary two-yr govt bond yield falls to 21.99 pct.</title>
<headline>Hungary two-yr govt bond yield falls to 21.99 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The average annual yield on the latest issue of Hungary's two-year government bonds was set by auction at 21.99 percent, down from 22.85 percent at an auction two weeks ago, the Government Debt Management Agency said on Thursday.</p>
<p>    Total on offer	     8,000 million forints</p>
<p>    Total bids received     56.237.73 million forints</p>
<p>    Total allocated	    8,000 million forints</p>
<p>    Total issued		 8,400 million forints</p>
<p>    Average annual yield	    21.99 pct</p>
<p>    Average price		    100.81 pct</p>
</text>
